[00:00.000 --> 00:07.000]  Here I have a motor spinning a blade placed on a floating boat so there's no friction to interfere.
[00:07.000 --> 00:11.000]  Right now the boat isn't moving meaning it's total angular momentum is zero.
[00:11.000 --> 00:16.000]  But now watch what happens when I suddenly reverse the direction of the spinning blade.
[00:16.000 --> 00:20.000]  To compensate for this and keep total angular momentum conserved,
[00:20.000 --> 00:23.000]  the boat must start spinning in the opposite direction.
