[01:22.000 --> 01:28.000]  We have set up the liquid metal vortex to spin by placing an inside of that ring of 11 magnets.
[01:28.000 --> 01:33.000]  We've added a red wire to the center and a black wire to the outside.
[01:33.000 --> 01:39.000]  And there's go to a DC battery over here. We have a little resistance wire on both sides called NICrome,
