[01:47.000 --> 01:55.000]  Now when we hook up the DC battery, you can see the liquid metal begins to spin very rapidly.
[01:56.000 --> 02:00.000]  We take off the DC battery and it stops.
[02:01.000 --> 02:05.000]  We change the way the leads are connected to this battery, flip red for black.
[02:05.000 --> 02:09.000]  Now it spins clockwise as a liquid metal vortex.
[02:09.000 --> 02:13.000]  And that's just like it does in this crop picture here, spinning clockwise.
