[00:00.000 --> 00:15.000]  Today we will test a new and promising lead which might help us to discover UFO physics.
[00:15.000 --> 00:19.000]  We'll start from these alien-made crop pictures here.
[00:19.000 --> 00:25.000]  Which appeared in 2002. You can see we have six wire coils as a kind of star shape.
[00:25.000 --> 00:29.500]  So I put one, two, three, four, five, six wire coils around.
[00:55.000 --> 01:00.000]  This rotating and opposite directions just like they drew here.
[01:25.000 --> 01:28.000]  This is a very important thing to do.
[01:28.000 --> 01:31.000]  We need to turn things on and see what happens.
[01:31.000 --> 01:36.000]  Turn on the three-phase power and the variable frequency device.
[01:36.000 --> 01:40.000]  It only has five hertz. You can see there are six wire coils.
[01:40.000 --> 01:47.000]  The flow wheel is outside. The speed of the inter-cloth wise is a major concern.
[01:47.000 --> 01:52.000]  The speed of the inter-cloth wise is a trimmer for the power.
[01:52.000 --> 02:00.000]  The inter-cloth wise outside is a trimmer for the system.
[02:00.000 --> 02:05.000]  The reason it's doing that is six wire coils are wired with three-phase power.
[02:05.000 --> 02:11.000]  The series of UVW, UVW, two sets going around.
[02:12.000 --> 02:16.000]  And if we turn the power a little bit more.
[02:18.000 --> 02:23.000]  The flow wheel will be faster and faster and faster.
[02:23.000 --> 02:34.000]  When the inter-cloth wise is a little, it goes inter-cloth wise outside.
[02:34.000 --> 02:36.000]  That's pretty cool, isn't it?
[02:36.000 --> 02:40.000]  You won't see that in any textbook. It's all new here.
[02:42.000 --> 02:46.000]  Just to confirm, when we only turn on three wire coils down here,
[02:46.000 --> 02:51.000]  it raises a triangle UVW and add three-phase power from this device,
[02:51.000 --> 02:54.000]  the magnet in the center spins clockwise.
[02:55.000 --> 02:59.000]  It's quite strong, isn't it?
[02:59.000 --> 03:01.000]  It's a little, isn't it?
[03:07.000 --> 03:09.000]  Three-cool.
[03:11.000 --> 03:15.000]  Once again, if we only turn on this power supply,
[03:15.000 --> 03:18.000]  which runs those six-wire coils,
[03:18.000 --> 03:20.000]  we turn off the three coils below.
[03:20.000 --> 03:25.000]  Now the outer flow wheel spins anti-cloth wise,
[03:25.000 --> 03:30.000]  and the magnet inside spins clockwise.
[03:33.000 --> 03:37.000]  So the net spinning at a momentum of the system is close to zero.
[03:37.000 --> 03:43.000]  It cancels, and that might have dramatic influences when you turn the wall between the three coils.
